WEBVTT

00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:08.500
Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:15.580
ima wa ugokenai sore ga sadame dakedo

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:15.580
Right now I can't move... That is my fate, but...

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:20.720
akirame wa shinai mou mezameta kara

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:20.720
I won't give up anymore because I have awakened.

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:25.890
moeru tokimeki wa jidai wo utsushi

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:25.890
My burning, throbbing heart reflects the era...

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:31.060
iro azayaka ni moesakaru honoo

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:31.060
It has the color of vividly blazing flames...

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:35.820
Crying ima wa mienaku tomo

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:35.820
Crying, though I can't see it right now...

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:40.350
Searching michi shirube wa ukabu

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:40.350
Searching, a guidepost floats up ahead.

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:43.170
I wanna have a pure time!

00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:48.280
Everyone's a noble mind!

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:53.500
soko ni nokotta wakasa toridashi

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:53.500
I'll take out what remains of my youth there,

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.980
Believing a sign of Zeta,

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.540
beyond the hard times from now!

00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:06.320
kawaku kuchibiru nureteiru nara

00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:06.320
If these dry lips become wet,

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:11.460
toki wo norikoe atsui jidai e to

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:11.460
Beyond time, towards a passionate era,

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:16.500
utsuru darou to shinjiteiru kara

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:16.500
Because I believe it will move...

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:19.060
Believing a sign of Zeta,

00:01:19.060 --> 00:01:23.690
beyond the hard times from now...

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:35.100
The Winds of Jaburo

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:39.500
The mobile suit troops launched
from the satellite orbit...

00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:42.910
...descended to the Titans' base in Jaburo.

00:02:00.460 --> 00:02:02.690
Th-This kind of one-sided battle is unfair!

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:06.360
And they're not attacking
with that new model!

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:30.720
Jaburo is the Earth Federation Forces' base,
situated underground...

00:02:30.990 --> 00:02:35.220
...upstream along the Amazon River,
but it is practically controlled by Titans.

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:01.950
S-So this is what Earth's gravity feels like...!

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:22.940
I want the first platoon
to head over to Area One!

00:03:23.210 --> 00:03:25.270
Report to the launcher
unless you're surveillance!

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:34.320
The A.E.U.G. has begun their attack.

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:36.920
How do you know?

00:03:36.920 --> 00:03:38.820
It could be a rebel movement from within.

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:40.790
They're right on time!

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:44.160
If only I could have contacted them...

00:03:44.230 --> 00:03:47.160
I would've advised them
not to attack this place!

00:03:47.230 --> 00:03:49.860
I'd like to think of this
as a chance to escape.

00:03:49.940 --> 00:03:53.560
There's absolutely no way!
After going through such disgrace!

00:03:53.640 --> 00:03:56.400
But unless we do something,
we'll lose our lives here.

00:03:56.480 --> 00:03:57.640
Why's that?

00:03:57.710 --> 00:04:01.810
The guys from the A.E.U.G.
could easily decide to destroy this building!

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:20.660
Here they come.

00:04:33.510 --> 00:04:35.540
How am I going to find
the Gundam Mk. II?!

00:04:43.320 --> 00:04:45.690
Now I believe there's a god!

00:04:46.060 --> 00:04:48.050
I'm gonna make you pay for Kacricon's death!

00:05:14.490 --> 00:05:15.780
Blast!

00:05:24.530 --> 00:05:26.900
You wouldn't have been killed
if you hadn't come out!

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:44.420
If you try to retaliate, you'll die pointlessly!

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:46.380
Why can't you understand that?!

00:05:53.730 --> 00:05:55.690
The pilot in there...!

00:05:59.930 --> 00:06:01.700
<i>Kamille, where are you?!</i>

00:06:01.770 --> 00:06:03.700
<i>Answer if you're still alive!</i>

00:06:03.770 --> 00:06:06.600
- I'm alive!
- <i>We're gathering at point 203!</i>

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:08.840
I'll be on my way!

00:06:13.780 --> 00:06:15.510
You're doomed, now that
I've caught up to you!

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:17.440
Damn you!

00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:25.220
What's wrong?! We're on Earth!

00:06:25.290 --> 00:06:27.620
We should have the advantage
over the A.E.U.G.!

00:06:32.430 --> 00:06:35.890
That's not only a Wave Rider,
it's also a hovercraft!

00:06:44.740 --> 00:06:46.710
Is Kamille's Mk. II okay?

00:06:58.820 --> 00:07:00.490
Is that it?!

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:14.300
<i>What's wrong?!</i>
<i>Did you incur any damage?!</i>

00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:16.310
No! Sorry about that!

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:19.040
<i>Okay, let's proceed.</i>

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:38.860
So this is Jaburo.

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:40.760
That's strange.

00:07:40.830 --> 00:07:43.820
This is nothing close to the retaliation
we expected from Jaburo.

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:45.630
There's something to this.

00:07:46.140 --> 00:07:47.300
Let's go!

00:07:47.370 --> 00:07:49.100
We should be facing their primary defense!

00:07:49.170 --> 00:07:50.330
<i>Yes, sir!</i>

00:08:08.860 --> 00:08:11.350
<i>It's too quiet. This is odd.</i>

00:08:11.830 --> 00:08:13.630
<i>It's as if the base is abandoned.</i>

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:16.530
I want three units to remain here, got that?!

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:19.890
Gather all prisoners in one place,
and begin interrogating the senior officers!

00:08:20.370 --> 00:08:22.570
The rest, we're going to Area One
to back them up!

00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:29.780
I'm not letting the Spacenoids
do as they wish here.

00:08:29.850 --> 00:08:32.010
Earth is our home!

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:37.850
Area One has been taken over completely.

00:08:37.920 --> 00:08:39.080
That's impossible!

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:42.960
How can you guys give this place up
so easily?!

00:08:43.030 --> 00:08:46.160
In fact, we're presently in the midst
of moving out of Jaburo!

00:08:46.230 --> 00:08:48.890
Moving out? But why?!

00:08:48.970 --> 00:08:52.270
We received orders.
For that reason, we've brought in Garudas...

00:08:52.440 --> 00:08:53.870
This is eerie.

00:08:53.940 --> 00:08:55.960
The buildings in Area One
are almost all empty.

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:57.240
You're right.

00:08:57.310 --> 00:08:59.970
Do you suppose the Titans have evacuated
from here?

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:02.270
We might've walked right into a trap.

00:09:02.350 --> 00:09:04.840
We never got word from Ensign Reccoa,
who should've arrived here before us.

00:09:05.550 --> 00:09:08.750
Interrogate the prisoners.
Find out where they moved to!

00:09:08.820 --> 00:09:09.790
Yes, sir!

00:09:09.990 --> 00:09:11.320
How's Kamille doing?

00:09:11.390 --> 00:09:12.650
Great.

00:09:12.720 --> 00:09:14.820
It appears Mr. Wong's "corrections"
are working wonders.

00:09:15.230 --> 00:09:17.220
You mean, back in Amman.

00:09:30.710 --> 00:09:32.730
This place is Area Two.

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:39.150
No one here in Area Two either.

00:09:40.750 --> 00:09:42.880
- <i>Miss Reccoa's here!</i>
- What?!

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:45.490
Miss Reccoa is here!

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:46.290
<i>Did you see her?</i>

00:09:46.530 --> 00:09:49.460
No, but I felt it.

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:53.970
Found them!

00:09:54.030 --> 00:09:55.760
It's the Gundam Mk. II and the new model!

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:00.360
Just a knockoff of Gundam Mk. II!

00:10:07.980 --> 00:10:10.040
This guy plays dirty,
using his ally as a shield!

00:10:10.650 --> 00:10:13.050
It's not a knockoff! Who's piloting it?!

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:19.890
Are you positive?!

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:21.320
We've got one hour!

00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:23.360
I'm sure of it! Please believe me!

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:26.230
You can keep me as a prisoner,
for all I care! Just get me out of here!

00:10:26.300 --> 00:10:27.200
You're lying!

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:29.960
Nukes have been prohibited
ever since the Antarctic Treaty!

00:10:30.200 --> 00:10:34.200
But I saw the commander of this place
switch on the triggering device!

00:10:34.270 --> 00:10:36.400
We have no time!

00:10:37.210 --> 00:10:39.140
How dare you make this up!

00:10:39.210 --> 00:10:40.300
Stop it!

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:43.450
We'll know in an hour whether he's lying.

00:10:43.520 --> 00:10:45.420
Isn't there any way to defuse that device?

00:10:45.850 --> 00:10:47.180
Who the hell's going to be 
able to do anything...

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:49.120
...about a nuclear bomb
buried underground?

00:10:49.190 --> 00:10:51.280
You can't expect me to believe
that nonsense.

00:10:51.360 --> 00:10:55.450
If you find out after all that I'm lying,
you can go ahead and execute me!

00:10:55.760 --> 00:10:57.630
But in the meantime,
please get me out of here right now!

00:10:57.700 --> 00:10:58.660
I beg you!

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:14.270
<i>Lieutenant! You must retreat!</i>

00:11:14.350 --> 00:11:16.540
<i>We don't have much time! Please retreat!</i>

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:18.750
Is that him, there?

00:11:28.260 --> 00:11:29.450
<i>No more firepower?</i>

00:11:31.400 --> 00:11:33.590
The Gundam's out of energy?!

00:11:35.030 --> 00:11:36.300
Kamille, I'll finish you!

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:46.170
Goodbye!

00:11:46.240 --> 00:11:47.400
Watch me, Lila!

00:11:51.180 --> 00:11:53.280
This is to avenge Lila's death...!

00:12:23.950 --> 00:12:25.680
Damn Gundam!

00:12:35.890 --> 00:12:36.950
Blast it!

00:12:50.310 --> 00:12:51.000
Is it Reccoa?

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:04.210
There's no need to confirm it.

00:13:04.290 --> 00:13:06.450
What this officer says is true.

00:13:06.520 --> 00:13:08.650
Then please give orders to pull out at once!

00:13:09.230 --> 00:13:12.090
Coming from a man who doesn't give
a damn about polluting Earth.

00:13:12.160 --> 00:13:13.820
We have word from the computer room!

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:17.160
Two nuclear bombs are found
150 meters underground...

00:13:17.240 --> 00:13:19.200
...and will explode in thirty-five minutes!

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:20.760
They cannot be deactivated!

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:22.900
The circuit's been severed, I assume.

00:13:22.970 --> 00:13:23.940
Yes, sir!

00:13:24.010 --> 00:13:25.700
Can we escape?

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:30.770
We seized two Garudas, but they're not
equipped with shuttles for pilot escape.

00:13:31.720 --> 00:13:34.120
So we don't have time
to send our pilots back to space.

00:13:34.350 --> 00:13:36.220
Why don't you think about that
after you survive this?

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:39.120
Get everyone on the Garudas
in twenty minutes!

00:13:39.190 --> 00:13:41.280
- The prisoners, too?
- Of course!

00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:41.920
Yes, sir!

00:13:41.990 --> 00:13:42.820
Thank you!

00:13:42.890 --> 00:13:45.290
I'll report this to the Federation
Government so your good actions...

00:13:45.360 --> 00:13:49.160
I'm not concerned about
whether you live or not!

00:13:49.230 --> 00:13:53.900
We just might have some use for hostages!
That's all!

00:13:56.470 --> 00:13:59.270
Apolly, did you find out
about the officers' residences?

00:13:59.340 --> 00:14:00.330
Of course.

00:14:00.410 --> 00:14:02.710
But we couldn't find out specifically
about Captain Bright's home.

00:14:02.780 --> 00:14:04.110
I see.

00:14:04.180 --> 00:14:05.550
And what about Mirai Yashima
and their children?

00:14:05.880 --> 00:14:07.820
That area was completely deserted, too.

00:14:07.890 --> 00:14:09.220
Is that so.

00:14:09.650 --> 00:14:11.320
Wait!

00:14:11.390 --> 00:14:14.050
I'm telling you to wait!

00:14:17.060 --> 00:14:18.830
If only Kacricon were here.

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:26.400
<i>I wouldn't have ended up</i>
<i>in this embarrassing state!</i>

00:14:31.240 --> 00:14:33.140
One, two, and three!

00:14:36.820 --> 00:14:38.210
The battery's still charged.

00:14:38.280 --> 00:14:42.190
- Really?
- L-Let me on!

00:14:42.990 --> 00:14:44.820
Don't worry! Hop on!

00:14:44.890 --> 00:14:47.590
<i>All mobile suits!</i>
<i>Retreat to the number one runway!</i>

00:14:47.660 --> 00:14:49.150
<i>We're abandoning Jaburo!</i>

00:14:49.230 --> 00:14:52.490
<i>All mobile suits!</i>
<i>Retreat to the number one runway!</i>

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:04.100
Throw away your gun belts,
or you aren't getting on!

00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:06.700
Move to the back to make more room!
We'll get you all on if we can!

00:15:06.780 --> 00:15:08.580
You still haven't heard from Kamille?!

00:15:08.650 --> 00:15:09.640
No!

00:15:10.280 --> 00:15:13.150
With the wireless relay machine,
he should've heard us!

00:15:13.690 --> 00:15:15.050
What do you suggest, Lieutenant Quattro?!

00:15:15.490 --> 00:15:17.010
I'll return to Area One!

00:15:17.090 --> 00:15:19.720
- Huh?
- Make sure you take off on time!

00:15:19.790 --> 00:15:21.760
All right?!

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:24.800
But Lieutenant Quattro...!

00:15:25.630 --> 00:15:28.000
Don't worry! I'll be back in time!

00:15:28.630 --> 00:15:31.470
Kamille was saying something
about Reccoa being here.

00:15:33.810 --> 00:15:37.070
- It's awfully quiet.
- Nobody's returning.

00:15:37.140 --> 00:15:39.340
Everyone's left. Friends <i>and</i> foes.

00:15:39.810 --> 00:15:43.610
Are you suggesting something as crazy
as everyone moving out of here at once?

00:15:43.680 --> 00:15:45.010
Not likely.

00:15:45.220 --> 00:15:46.510
Wh-What's this?!

00:15:48.390 --> 00:15:49.350
Kamille?

00:15:49.620 --> 00:15:50.850
What is it?

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:53.080
Huh? N-Nothing.

00:15:57.430 --> 00:16:00.300
Hey, there are people here!

00:16:00.370 --> 00:16:03.130
Shouting won't do us any good.
Not from where we are.

00:16:03.200 --> 00:16:05.140
It's better than not doing anything.

00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:06.170
Hey!

00:16:08.240 --> 00:16:10.170
- There are people here!
- Hey!!

00:16:10.810 --> 00:16:12.110
Miss Reccoa!

00:16:12.180 --> 00:16:13.510
Is that you, Miss Reccoa?!

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:20.320
Miss Reccoa!

00:16:20.390 --> 00:16:21.350
<i>Kamille!</i>

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:22.850
Miss Reccoa!

00:16:32.060 --> 00:16:32.960
A Gundam?!

00:16:33.030 --> 00:16:35.800
- It's Kamille! Kamille Bidan!
- Kamille?

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:43.760
Kamille. You've come.

00:16:43.840 --> 00:16:45.830
He's piloting the Gundam?

00:16:45.910 --> 00:16:46.740
Step back!

00:16:55.590 --> 00:16:56.550
Kamille!

00:16:56.860 --> 00:16:58.550
Kamille! Boy, am I glad to see you!

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:00.320
Same here. I'm glad you're okay,
Miss Reccoa.

00:17:00.390 --> 00:17:03.290
- You look young.
- And you are?

00:17:03.360 --> 00:17:06.760
This is Mr. Kai Shiden,
who helped me sneak into Jaburo.

00:17:06.930 --> 00:17:09.330
Mr.... Kai Shiden?

00:17:10.030 --> 00:17:12.800
My intentions were to cooperate
with Miss Reccoa...

00:17:12.870 --> 00:17:15.500
...but I ended up causing her
hardship instead.

00:17:16.070 --> 00:17:17.040
Hardship?

00:17:18.580 --> 00:17:23.410
He's referring to the fact
that all was going perfectly...

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:26.250
...until we got caught
trying to contact the Argama from here.

00:17:26.320 --> 00:17:28.680
Why was the enemy here so quick
to evacuate the place?

00:17:29.490 --> 00:17:31.480
They were in the midst
of moving out of here.

00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:32.960
It's not surprising that they'd
abandon the place outright!

00:17:33.190 --> 00:17:34.160
Impossible!

00:17:34.430 --> 00:17:37.920
Otherwise even your Gundam
wouldn't have made it this far in here.

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:41.760
Please get on Mk. II's hand.

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:43.130
We'll join the main unit.

00:17:45.600 --> 00:17:46.930
Kamille, huh?

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:49.640
- Lieutenant Quattro?!
- An ally?

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:51.640
- It's Lieutenant Quattro!
- That is?

00:17:52.140 --> 00:17:53.800
<i>Are you immobile, Kamille?!</i>

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:56.310
<i>The nuclear bombs in this place</i>
<i>will blow in ten minutes!</i>

00:17:57.150 --> 00:17:59.510
If your Gundam can't move,
the Hyaku Shiki will carry you!

00:17:59.580 --> 00:18:01.850
- Run over here!
- <i>I found Miss Reccoa!</i>

00:18:02.420 --> 00:18:05.290
<i>I also rescued a man</i>
<i>by the name of Kai Shiden!</i>

00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:08.020
Good work! We're getting out!

00:18:08.090 --> 00:18:08.850
<i>Yes, sir!</i>

00:18:09.830 --> 00:18:11.990
I'm telling you to let me on!
You can fit more!

00:18:12.060 --> 00:18:15.690
- We only need one pilot!
- You can fit more!

00:18:15.770 --> 00:18:18.400
- What's this?!
- We can board three times capacity!

00:18:18.470 --> 00:18:20.770
From this point on,
rely on your own strengths to survive.

00:18:20.840 --> 00:18:23.070
If you're lucky, you're not going to die.

00:18:23.140 --> 00:18:24.110
Lieutenant!

00:18:24.180 --> 00:18:27.110
- Don't push!
- Help!

00:18:27.180 --> 00:18:29.340
What awaits those who lack the strength
is death.

00:18:29.450 --> 00:18:31.420
What awaits those who...!

00:18:32.520 --> 00:18:33.780
What are you doing?!

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:16.890
- <i>We're out of time!</i>
- <i>Wait a little longer!</i>

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:19.120
- <i>We can't! Enemies approaching!</i>
- <i>What?!</i>

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:20.220
Three units?!

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:25.830
<i>We've got to go! I'm sure</i>
<i>Lieutenant Quattro will escape safely!</i>

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:37.540
Nemo unit!

00:19:37.620 --> 00:19:39.010
Fire at them from the side hatch!

00:19:39.080 --> 00:19:41.310
There they are! The Hyaku Shiki
and the Gundam!

00:19:41.390 --> 00:19:42.350
What?

00:19:42.690 --> 00:19:43.750
Lieutenant Quattro!

00:19:44.320 --> 00:19:45.410
Don't fall!

00:19:49.230 --> 00:19:52.160
Fly, Gundam!
I'll keep the enemy back!

00:19:58.100 --> 00:19:59.930
<i>Come up closer!</i>

00:20:04.380 --> 00:20:05.240
A little closer!

00:20:05.310 --> 00:20:06.400
<i>I know!</i>

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:13.740
Don't let them escape alive!

00:20:13.820 --> 00:20:14.880
<i>Stop it!</i>

00:20:14.950 --> 00:20:17.280
<i>The nukes will explode in one minute!</i>

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:18.250
Who are you?!

00:20:18.760 --> 00:20:21.520
Lieutenant Commander Jiddeley
of the Federation Forces!

00:20:21.590 --> 00:20:22.790
You guys should hurry outta here, too!

00:20:23.290 --> 00:20:24.850
Cut out your nonsense!

00:20:34.410 --> 00:20:35.700
<i>Lieutenant! Kamille! Get back here!</i>

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:38.510
- <i>Kamille! Go!</i>
- <i>Get on!</i>

00:20:38.580 --> 00:20:39.570
The Garuda...!

00:20:39.640 --> 00:20:40.630
<i>Go, Kamille!</i>

00:20:40.710 --> 00:20:42.240
- You too, Lieutenant!
- <i>Sure!</i>

00:20:42.310 --> 00:20:43.640
I'm going!

00:20:47.350 --> 00:20:49.150
Can I reach it?

00:20:59.260 --> 00:21:00.920
- All right!
- Whoa!

00:21:07.970 --> 00:21:12.470
Our Forces must recapture that Garuda
for our use.

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:15.410
- <i>Chief!</i>
- What is it?!

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:48.910
That person's Lieutenant Quattro Bajeena?

00:21:48.980 --> 00:21:49.950
Yes.

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:53.750
- An unidentified plane?
- Yes, sir!

00:21:53.820 --> 00:21:55.750
Depending on circumstances,
we might intercept it!

00:21:55.820 --> 00:21:57.950
- Then I'll go, and...!
- No, wait.

00:22:01.660 --> 00:22:03.720
There's no question, that's an ally.

00:22:03.800 --> 00:22:05.560
They could be from Karaba.

00:22:10.640 --> 00:22:12.970
He says he's Hayato Kobayashi of Karaba.

00:22:13.040 --> 00:22:14.330
As I thought.

00:22:14.410 --> 00:22:16.070
He says he will guide us.

00:22:16.140 --> 00:22:17.660
Okay, follow him.

00:22:22.180 --> 00:22:24.010
Hayato Kobayashi...

00:22:25.080 --> 00:22:26.570
And Kai Shiden...!

00:22:47.270 --> 00:22:49.600
Oh, I can't help believing you

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
kanarazu aeru to ano hi kara shinjiteita

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
I've believed we're sure to meet again ever since that day

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
kitto yobiau kokoro ga areba

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
If we have heart, we'll be called together again

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
mugen no Energy yobisamasu

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
Awaken the infinite energy

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
aa kizutsukeau mae ni

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
Before you get hurt

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
dekiru koto sagashite Please

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
Find what you can do...Please

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
nagedasanai de kurushii toki koso

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
Don't throw it away because of this painful age

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
itsuka mita aoi sora wo

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
Until the day we gaze up again

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
kitto anata to miageru hi made

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
at the blue sky we once saw

00:23:46.670 --> 00:23:51.110
Even if we have to use outdated shuttles,
the pilots must be sent back to space.

00:23:51.180 --> 00:23:54.110
However, in order to stall attacks
from the mysterious mobile armor...

00:23:54.180 --> 00:23:56.670
...Roberto loses his life.

00:23:57.480 --> 00:23:59.420
Also of concern is the future of Fraw Bow
and her children...

00:23:59.490 --> 00:24:01.280
...who have escaped to Amuro's residence.

00:24:01.960 --> 00:24:06.360
Next on Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam
"Shuttle Launch".

00:24:07.290 --> 00:24:10.030
You will see the tears of time.

00:24:07.470 --> 00:24:12.470
Next Episode

00:24:07.470 --> 00:24:12.470
Shuttle Launch
